If all the judgments taken note herein above are read in conjunction, Hon'ble Apex Court has categorically held that court,
while considering prayer for grant of bail, may not be impressed with arguments advanced by the prosecution, that charge against the person seeking bail is serious, but in case, court finds that on account of inordinate delay in conclusion of trial, fundamental right of speedy trial is being violated,
it should proceed to grant bail.
